'''Ursae''' is a monster group (akin to [[wikipedia:Subfamily|subfamily]] of real world biology). According to the in-game [[Bestiary]], it has two [[wikipedia:Genus|genera]] in-game: [[gargantuan]] and [[Plummeting ursa (monster type)|plummeting ursa]]. Ursae belongs to The Wilds [[wikipedia:family (biology)|family]].

Ursa in Latin means (female) bear.<ref>https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ursa</ref> The male form is ursus.<ref>https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ursus</ref> The in-game monster [[Tyrannursus Maximus]] is an undead gargantuan.
